# Conformance probe pack for absent-value sentinels (spec 0.9) on the
# `geojson` wire. Public. No kinds. Exercises ruling 10: a coordinate slot is
# compared by the canonical text of its number; a sentinel written for `lon`
# or `lat` counts as a value, so `geometry` is written and not `null`; a
# sentinel for `alt` is written as the third element. Also the empty text
# `""` on a top-level member and on a `properties` member.
format  conformance-absent-geojson
version 0.9.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
wire    geojson
field   uid       id               string  absent ""
field   callsign  properties.name  string  absent ""
field   lon       geometry.lon     float   absent 181
field   lat       geometry.lat     float   absent 91
field   hae       geometry.alt     float   absent 9999999.0
